      "article_id": "a1_b292097b77d80bbb8127c411",
      "headline": "Nvidia's latest driver update breaks mVolt+ overclocking functionality — Nifty, open-source app allowed users to increase the power limit to 700W on their RTX 50-series GPUs without hardware mods",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Nvidia's latest driver update breaks mVolt+ overclocking functionality — Nifty, open-source app allowed users to increase the power limit to 700W on their RTX 50-series GPUs without hardware mods Using the app results in a driver crash.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506416+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "Nvidia's latest driver update breaks mVolt+ overclocking functionality — Nifty, open-source app allowed users to increase the power limit to 700W on their RTX 50-series GPUs without hardware mods Using the app results in a driver crash.",
          "sentence_hash": "ea44ebd8fc446d3bb04d1af1bc0d962ec80f34daef6bcb8a4fcb57dbeba862d2",
          "anchors": [
            "overclock",
            "hardware",
            "oc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Nvidia's current-gen Blackwell family includes some of the best graphics cards on the market with exceptional performance, but pushing silicon to its limit can always unlock more power.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506434+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "Nvidia's current-gen Blackwell family includes some of the best graphics cards on the market with exceptional performance, but pushing silicon to its limit can always unlock more power.",
          "sentence_hash": "c82b38c44cae645febb60ecc74bf888428c188bf4e735c31b75e7afdefd6546b",
          "anchors": [
            "some",
            "mark",
            "oc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "This is where enthusiast software, such as mVolt+, comes in, allowing users to overclock their GPUs beyond what's usually permissible.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506448+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "This is where enthusiast software, such as mVolt+, comes in, allowing users to overclock their GPUs beyond what's usually permissible.",
          "sentence_hash": "f87885770ba6674e7acb4543de45728c53420f9518a40ac748f79c8162469142",
          "anchors": [
            "overclock",
            "oc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Unlike mainstream GPU utilities like MSI Afterburner, mVolt+ bypasses standard driver restrictions and gives you more granular control over a few hardware blocks.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506465+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "Unlike mainstream GPU utilities like MSI Afterburner, mVolt+ bypasses standard driver restrictions and gives you more granular control over a few hardware blocks.",
          "sentence_hash": "8505a1d233d7b3f9c6a94e6174bda7189fe5e63449a8f5668117723f66187394",
          "anchors": [
            "hardware",
            "you",
            "oc"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The app can tweak separate power targets for the core and memory channels.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506475+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "The app can tweak separate power targets for the core and memory channels.",
          "sentence_hash": "906f64194370ebc8bb5857fe4098fdc60ef4f696095ad61f049260e3c5f4ea35",
          "anchors": [
            "core"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "It can also provide access to voltage and clock offsets for Core, XBAR, SYS, and VRAM.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-01T08:05:27.506486+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "79bf4b4650e19297d3de22a200aba99c5f55ce328431bfa685e1156197299dcf",
          "excerpt": "It can also provide access to voltage and clock offsets for Core, XBAR, SYS, and VRAM.",
          "sentence_hash": "9468af7c249ebd45ef2933b0c212a65dff94aa71a325c34081bc6e35853c336c",
          "anchors": [
            "pro",
            "volt",
            "oc"
          ]
        }
      ],
