      "coverage": {
        "has_fulltext": true,
        "has_multiple_sources": true,
        "fact_count": 6,
        "anchor_count": 38
      },
      "summary": "Overclocking utility mVolt+ seems to have been blocked by the latest Nvidia driver update, hard crashing the moment you try to adjust the core power limit. However, it seems like a driver conflict more than a deliberate blacklist since another app, Hydra 2.3B Pro, is working just fine.",
      "category": "科技",
      "published_at": 